{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/client\/refreshauthtoken(reason:inretryloop:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client\/refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","extendedModule":"Yorkie","title":"refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)","externalID":"s:6Yorkie6ClientC16refreshAuthToken6reason11inRetryLoopySSSg_SbtYaKF","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"refreshAuthToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reason","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inRetryLoop","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Asks "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"authTokenInjector"},{"type":"text","text":" for a new token after a 401."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"refreshAuthToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reason","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"inRetryLoop"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The reason from the webhook response.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"reason"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Whether a retry loop got the 401.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"inRetryLoop"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a loop, a failure is treated as transient: the previous token is kept and the loop is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"still told to retry. Each failure in a row doubles the wait before the injector is called"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AuthRefreshBackoff\/delayMs(failures:)"},{"type":"text","text":"); a loop’s 401 that arrives sooner skips it,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the loop’s retry waits until then, but at most 5s for it ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"loopRetryDelay(_:_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"). A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one-shot call ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inRetryLoop"},{"type":"text","text":" false) always calls it and gets its error thrown: the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retried on purpose, the token API may be back, and the injector’s error is how the app learns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"why it failed."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each 401 makes its own call; they do not join one call, since an injector that never settles"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"would then hold every later 401 too. A call that settles after a later one already set its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"token neither sets its own nor changes the backoff, so an older token never overrides a newer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, and a call still pending when the client activates again does not override the new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session’s token. 401s that arrive together, such as the sync loop’s and the Watch streams’"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the token expires, count as one failure."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The injector’s error, for a one-shot call.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Client":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Client"}],"abstract":[{"code":"Client","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a normal client that can communicate with the server.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It has documents and sends changes of the documents in local"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the server to synchronize with other replicas in remote."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Client"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"Client","url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/client"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie":{"title":"Yorkie","identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/Client/refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/yorkie\/client\/refreshauthtoken(reason:inretryloop:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Asks "},{"code":"authTokenInjector","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for a new token after a 401."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"refreshAuthToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"reason","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inRetryLoop","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Client\/refreshAuthToken(reason:inRetryLoop:)"}}}